<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>多因子研究实验报告</title>
<style>body{font:14px Arial,"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#eef2f5;color:#173048;margin:0}main{max-width:1240px;margin:28px auto;padding:40px;background:#fff}h1,h2{color:#173b5e}.notice{padding:14px;background:#fff7e8;border-left:4px solid #bd8d35}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:18px 0}th{background:#173b5e;color:white;text-align:left}th,td{padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce3e8}tr:nth-child(even){background:#f5f7fa}.selected{font-weight:bold;color:#166446}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.table-scroll{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}table{min-width:620px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}details{margin:20px 0}summary{min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:768px){main{margin:0;padding:20px 14px}h1{font-size:24px}}@media(min-width:769px){main{padding:32px}}</style></head><body><main>
<h1>多因子研究与策略实验报告</h1><p>{{ spec.start_date }} 至 {{ spec.end_date }} · {{ spec.symbols|length }} 只股票 · {{ spec.factors|length }} 个财务因子</p>
<p>{% if spec.stock_pool and spec.stock_pool.pool_id %}冻结股票池 {{ spec.stock_pool.pool_id }} · revision {{ spec.stock_pool.pool_revision or spec.stock_pool.revision }}{% else %}明确冻结股票范围{% endif %}：{{ spec.symbols|join('、') }}</p>
<details open><summary>实验参数与成本口径</summary><p>持仓数量：{{ spec.top_n_values|join('、') }}；调仓周期：{% for value in spec.rebalance_values %}{{ value|enum_label }} {% endfor %}；佣金：{{ spec.commission_bps_values|join('、') }} bp。</p><p>初始资金 {{ spec.initial_capital }}；滑点 {{ spec.slippage_bps }} bp；卖出印花税 {{ spec.stamp_duty_bps }} bp；买入整手 {{ spec.lot_size }} 股；缺失策略 {{ spec.missing_policy|enum_label }}。</p><p>训练比例 {{ spec.training_fraction }}；验证比例 {{ spec.validation_fraction }}；滚动验证轮次 {{ spec.walk_forward_folds }}。比例为原参数，真实日期区间见下方分段结果。</p></details>
<p class="notice">股票池：{{ diagnostics.universe_mode|enum_label }}；行业中性化：{{ diagnostics.industry_neutralization|enum_label }}；行业持仓上限：{{ (diagnostics.max_industry_weight * 100)|round(1) }}%。{% if diagnostics.survivorship_bias_warning %} {{ diagnostics.survivorship_bias_warning }}{% else %} 已按可信历史指数成分过滤。{% endif %} 模型只根据验证集排序；测试集不得参与参数选择。财报必须在信号日 15:00 前已公开。</p>
<h2>因子设置</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>因子</th><th>相对权重（原值）</th><th>方向</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in spec.factors %}<tr><td>{{ row.code|factor_label }}</td><td>{{ row.weight }}</td><td>{{ row.direction|enum_label }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<h2>因子有效性：IC / Rank IC</h2><p>{{ ic_explanation }}</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>因子</th><th>期数</th><th>IC 均值</th><th>Rank IC 均值</th><th>IC IR</th><th>正向占比</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in ic_summary %}<tr><td>{{ row.factor|factor_label }}</td><td>{{ row.periods }}</td><td>{{ row.mean_ic|number }}</td><td>{{ row.mean_rank_ic|number }}</td><td>{{ row.ic_ir|number }}</td><td>{{ row.positive_ic_ratio|pct }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<h2>参数扫描与策略对比</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>策略</th><th>总收益</th><th>年化</th><th>超额</th><th>最大回撤</th><th>夏普</th><th>入选</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in strategies %}<tr{% if row.selected_by_validation %} class="selected"{% endif %}><td>{{ row.strategy|strategy_label }}</td><td>{{ row.total_return|pct }}</td><td>{{ row.annualized_return|pct }}</td><td>{{ row.excess_return|pct }}</td><td>{{ row.max_drawdown|pct }}</td><td>{{ row.sharpe_ratio|number }}</td><td>{{ "验证集最优" if row.selected_by_validation else "" }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<h2>训练 / 验证 / 样本外</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>策略</th><th>分段</th><th>日期</th><th>收益</th><th>超额</th><th>夏普</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in segments if row.selected_by_validation %}<tr><td>{{ row.strategy|strategy_label }}</td><td>{{ row.segment|enum_label }}</td><td>{{ row.start_date }} — {{ row.end_date }}</td><td>{{ row.total_return|pct }}</td><td>{{ row.excess_return|pct }}</td><td>{{ row.sharpe_ratio|number }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<h2>年度因子稳定性</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>因子</th><th>年份</th><th>期数</th><th>IC</th><th>Rank IC</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in yearly %}<tr><td>{{ row.factor|factor_label }}</td><td>{{ row.year }}</td><td>{{ row.periods }}</td><td>{{ row.mean_ic|number }}</td><td>{{ row.mean_rank_ic|number }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<h2>滚动样本外验证</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>策略</th><th>轮次</th><th>训练结束</th><th>测试区间</th><th>测试收益</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in walk_forward %}<tr><td>{{ row.strategy|strategy_label }}</td><td>{{ row.fold }}</td><td>{{ row.train_end }}</td><td>{{ row.test_start }} — {{ row.test_end }}</td><td>{{ row.test_return|pct }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<p>权重用于截面排名后的加权合成；available 缺失策略会对有效因子重新归一权重，以上原值不代表资金占比。</p>
{% if group_returns %}<h2>因子分组的可观察未来收益</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>信号日期</th><th>因子</th><th>分组</th><th>样本数量</th><th>平均未来收益</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in group_returns %}<tr><td>{{ row.signal_date }}</td><td>{{ row.factor|factor_label }}</td><td>{{ row.group }}</td><td>{{ row.stock_count }}</td><td>{{ row.mean_forward_return|pct }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>{% endif %}
<p>表格沿用原报告最多 120 条记录的展示上限；完整明细请查看同运行导出的 CSV 或工作簿。未记录的统计量不填零。</p>
<details><summary>原参数与完整诊断（内部代码）</summary><pre>{{ spec_json }}</pre><pre>{{ diagnostics_json }}</pre></details>
</main></body></html>
